---
description: Conventions for SQL/Influx identifiers in this datasource
alwaysApply: true
---
Treat dotted identifiers as a first-class case, not an edge case.
Preserve correct quoting/escaping through parse -> plan -> query execution.
Add or update a test when changing identifier handling.
Never log credentials, tokens, or full connection strings.
If a change could alter query semantics, say so explicitly before applying.
